flowchart TD
    Request[Listener preferences and exclusions] --> Validate[Validate request]
    Validate -->|Valid| Rank[Filter artists and rank tracks]
    Validate -->|Invalid| Error[CLI error and exit]
    Catalog[(Song catalog CSV)] --> Rank
    Rank --> Gate[Keep tracks with similarity at least 0.65]
    Gate --> Select[Select tracks with optional diversity reranking]
    Select --> Output[Playlist or abstention with reasons and counts]
    Cases[Automated evaluation cases] -.-> Validate
    Cases -.-> Output
    Output --> Review[Listener reviews results and can revise preferences]
